Two stories

Write two stories. In `signup`, the `Browser` sends to `Accounts` with the
label `post`, and `Accounts` sends to `Mailer` with the label `welcome mail`.
In `reset`, the `Browser` sends to `Accounts` with the label `reset`, and
`Accounts` sends to `Mailer` with the label `reset link`.
---
story signup {
  Browser -> Accounts: post
  Accounts -> Mailer: welcome mail
}
story reset {
  Browser -> Accounts: reset
  Accounts -> Mailer: reset link
}
